* Canonical CORE INPUT for the native layout generator, NOT a transient model.
* Candidate v11 (cold current-density experiment): twelve data HBTs Nx=8, four selectors Nx=6; reference/tails unchanged.
* Same 19 HBT and 8 resistors as tx_mux54_passive_drive_v11.spice.
* No electrical or physical acceptance is implied by this source.
* Generator maps each body terminal to BULK and adds all 27 native 2x2um
* substrate contacts between public sub and BULK. Do not omit those contacts
* from electrical composition. Source equivalence is checked independently
* before physical generation; passing schematic screens is not layout proof.
* DRAFT: fresh native layout and extracted waveform acceptance remain pending.
.subckt nssoc_tx_mux2_final_drive_v11_layout_core ap an bp bn sp sn op on avdd avss sub iref
XREF iref iref avss sub npn13G2 Nx=1
XAP_0 qn ap ea sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XAP_1 qn ap ea sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XAP_2 qn ap ea sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XAN_0 qp an ea sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XAN_1 qp an ea sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XAN_2 qp an ea sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XBP_0 qn bp eb sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XBP_1 qn bp eb sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XBP_2 qn bp eb sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XBN_0 qp bn eb sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XBN_1 qp bn eb sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XBN_2 qp bn eb sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XSA_0 ea sp tail sub npn13G2 Nx=6
XSA_1 ea sp tail sub npn13G2 Nx=6
XSB_0 eb sn tail sub npn13G2 Nx=6
XSB_1 eb sn tail sub npn13G2 Nx=6
XT_0 tail iref avss sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XT_1 tail iref avss sub npn13G2 Nx=8
XRP avdd qp sub rppd w=18u l=1.1u b=0 sw_et=1
XRN avdd qn sub rppd w=18u l=1.1u b=0 sw_et=1
XBA ea avss sub rppd w=2u l=38.4u b=0 sw_et=1
XBB eb avss sub rppd w=2u l=38.4u b=0 sw_et=1
XFPR op avss sub rppd w=8u l=4.5u b=0 sw_et=1
XFNR on avss sub rppd w=8u l=4.5u b=0 sw_et=1
XSP qp op sub rppd w=8u l=1.8u b=0 sw_et=1
XSN qn on sub rppd w=8u l=1.8u b=0 sw_et=1
.ends nssoc_tx_mux2_final_drive_v11_layout_core
